# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional website + web companion env. Copy to `.env.local` if needed.
# `.env.local` is gitignored and must never be committed.
#
# The marketing site and guest web companion render with none of these set.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Canonical/OG/sitemap base URL (production default: https://phrasa.app)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Web companion cloud auth/sync.
# Apply only active migrations under supabase/migrations/ to the dedicated
# Phrasa project, then configure the matching Auth providers and callback URLs.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ values are bundled into browser JavaScript at build time.
# Use a publishable (anon) key only. Never put a service-role or secret key
# here, in a client environment, Info.plist, or git.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_PHRASA_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT_REF.supabase.co
# NEXT_PUBLIC_PHRASA_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_...
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
